---
import SiteShell from "../components/SiteShell.astro";
---

<SiteShell title="About" description="What Simple Sketchpad is and why it was built.">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">About Simple Sketchpad</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    Simple Sketchpad is a fast, minimal online drawing board. Pick a tool, draw, and your work is
    saved automatically in your browser — there is no account and nothing to set up.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">What you can do</h2>
  <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    <li><strong class="font-medium text-ink">Draw and sketch</strong> with a smooth brush or a lifelike graphite pencil.</li>
    <li><strong class="font-medium text-ink">Add shapes and text</strong> — rectangles, ellipses, triangles, lines, and arrows.</li>
    <li><strong class="font-medium text-ink">Work anywhere</strong> — touch, mouse, and stylus input across all your devices.</li>
    <li><strong class="font-medium text-ink">Perfect your drawing</strong> with undo/redo, adjustable opacity and stroke size, a grid, zoom, and pan.</li>
    <li><strong class="font-medium text-ink">Export your art</strong> as a PNG whenever you are ready.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Privacy first</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    Everything you draw stays on your own device. Your drawings are stored in your browser's local
    storage only and are never uploaded to a server. See the
    <a href="/privacy" class="font-medium text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-primary">Privacy Policy</a>
    for the details.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Questions or feedback?</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    We would love to hear from you — head over to the
    <a href="/contact" class="font-medium text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-primary">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</SiteShell>